    "paragraph": "A web-based survey of 417 adults evaluated participant perceptions of a proposed street redesign for cycling across a video of current conditions, a static 2D plan, and a dynamic interactive 3D model. A comparative study evaluated the QUBE participatory process methodology across two pilot neighborhoods in Switzerland to test how structured coordination among private homeowners supports local renewable energy projects. Finally, CountClusterNN used GPS probe vehicle trajectories to select optimal roadside sensor locations via K-Medoids clustering and subsequently trained a neural network to reconstruct traffic flows across unobserved roads.",
